{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tunguska 2: Whitefall is a work-in-progress sequel to top-down survival RPG Tunguska: The Visitation. This new adventure takes you to a new sector of the Exclusion Zone affected by Whitefall - a snow-like substance that swallows energy and bridges the Zone to higher dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit familiar faces from the First Generation, who have travelled deeper into the Zone searching for a better prospect: extracting artifacts from higher dimensions during Whitefall events in exchange for money, fame, and tickets to &quot;paradise&quot;. Will they succeed, and what dark secrets will be revealed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Features (evolving):</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arsenal of manufactured weapons from Warsaw Pact and NATO</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arsenal of makeshift weapons that can be customized and upgraded</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple companion system with item-sharing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded skills system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded survival stats including body heat management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded crafting</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3536500?t=1757521946","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536500/503623931e713004bc8bd76d96019dc741d2d904/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757521946","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536500/b5f4e42de5f09b44276a8df55e434ebc8fe45117/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757521946","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536500/b5f4e42de5f09b44276a8df55e434ebc8fe45117/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757521946","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descri